<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">Social Ladders</h1><p class="ref-lede">How 50 societies ranked their people, from the ruler down to the enslaved: who stood where, how many they were, what each rank could do, and how people rose or fell.</p></header>
